WEBVTT

NOTE Heartwood 2016 v6 (UiB job 28, S395). The same lines are drawn into the bar of both copies.

1
00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:06.500
[chimes]

2
00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:08.130
[upbeat jingle]

3
00:00:08.130 --> 00:00:10.180
Is a friendship
getting too close?

4
00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:12.210
The little booklet
with the checklist.

5
00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:13.960
Order a five-pack
for your group.

6
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.700
[upbeat menu music]

7
00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:22.740
Grab your journal and
your workbook, friend.

8
00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:24.620
Today we go underneath.

9
00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:28.240
For women, the teaching
names three roots:

10
00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:31.410
relationship issues,
an identity struggle,

11
00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:33.340
and a spiritual fallacy.

12
00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:36.351
It's not a sexual
orientation problem.

13
00:00:36.351 --> 00:00:38.490
It's an identity crisis.

14
00:00:40.980 --> 00:00:43.430
Here's a picture from
an older teaching.

15
00:00:43.430 --> 00:00:45.450
Nineteen ninety-three.

16
00:00:45.450 --> 00:00:47.530
Remember floppy disks?

17
00:00:47.530 --> 00:00:51.395
To use a computer analogy,
a heterosexual woman has

18
00:00:51.395 --> 00:00:55.093
a floppy disc that is titled
woman, so each experience that

19
00:00:55.093 --> 00:00:59.680
is related to her femaleness
can be stored in that file.

20
00:00:59.680 --> 00:01:02.202
The lesbian woman receives
information relating

21
00:01:02.202 --> 00:01:06.230
to femininity, but she
has no file to put it in.

22
00:01:06.230 --> 00:01:07.940
Save that one, friend.

23
00:01:09.560 --> 00:01:12.934
Emotional dependency is when
someone else's presence feels

24
00:01:12.934 --> 00:01:15.610
necessary for your security.

25
00:01:15.610 --> 00:01:17.080
Here are the signs.

26
00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:23.230
Now, many of these things
aren't sinful in themselves.

27
00:01:23.230 --> 00:01:26.971
Romantic gestures and certain
kinds of exclusivity are

28
00:01:26.971 --> 00:01:31.070
completely appropriate
in marriage and engagement.

29
00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:34.450
And sometimes even in
a serious dating relationship.

30
00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:39.800
[the course music plays out]

31
00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:42.300
[the disc skips and stops]

32
00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:52.200
[a low held chord]
